# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-serve-4 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/serve-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's image, its stop rule and its minutes. The image is tp4-serve-4 throughout: B4 builds it, the
# later jobs serve it, and a commit after B4's tag needs a new tag and every later job the new one.
# B4: build tp4-serve-4 and smoke the PRODUCTION configuration: c2-packed-tp4, the traffic profile, audits ON, the tail caps ON
# (QWEN_FAST_BUDGET_CAP=1) and the sequential-step watchdog at 120 s. This image adds, all off by default: the stall watch (stacks, the
# pinned tt-metal triage, then the end of the process, over engine builds, prefill segments, packed rounds and sequential steps), the
# capture plug, the collective handle guard, and a trace census whose graph part is off unless QWEN_FAST_TRACE_CENSUS_GRAPH=1 and
# which never reads a host tensor. The production profile sets none of them, so this job is v166's configuration on the new image.
# The test list is T1's SS list unchanged and in its order, then concurrent4_solo (each concurrent4 prompt alone at 800 tokens: this
# image's own full-text references for the four users) and the two coding-text concurrency tests.
# READ the log, not only the verdict: '[PINDIAG] packed-any admission passed:' and no UNQUALIFIED line; no late prefill program;
# c2_smoke_check clean with audit_mismatches 0; no watchdog or replay-deadline exit; every concurrent user at 800 tokens; every
# concurrent4 content and reasoning hash equal to its concurrent4_solo run; speed within 5% of v166 (coding 35.84, long_real_text 34.59,
# concurrent4 15.79, concurrent4_steady 17.24 tok/s). Record the live-4 round median beside v166's.
# Duration (estimate): 45 min. Stop rule: a hang on this configuration stops the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset build smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,tool_call,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning,refused_n2,alive_after_refusal,stream_dropped,alive_after_drop,concurrent4_solo,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal
